    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nDNG are delighted to present 205 Kimmage Road Lower to the market; a well maintained, character filled home in excellent condition, situated in this highly convenient location. With features such as off street parking to the front, rear pedestrian access and an attractive west-facing garden to the rear, this property is perfect for those seeking a family home in this sought after area. \n\nUpon entering the property you are greeted by a welcoming hallway with a front living room with bay window, a dining room and a spacious kitchen/dining area completing the downstairs accommodation. Upstairs there are three bedrooms, a family bathroom and an en suite shower room. The garden to the rear is approximately 55 foot at its longest point and the front driveway accommodates off street parking for one car.\n\nThe location of the property is ideal with Dublin city centre within walking distance. Harold's Cross, Portobello and Terenure are all nearby which leave some of Dublin's finest cafes, restaurants and bars all within easy reach of the house. Harold's Cross Park and Dublin's Grand Canal are ideal outdoor recreational areas which are located nearby. The area is also excellently serviced by regular bus routes."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 6.16m x 1.50m\n\n\nBreakfast Room - 5.10m x 2.60m\n\n\nKitchen - 2.41m x 2.60m\n\n\nDining Room - 3.40m x 3.25m\n\n\nLiving Room - 4.31m x 3.25m\n\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.46m max x 4.85m\n\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.40m x 3.25m\n\n\nBathroom - 2.79m x 1.40m\n\n\nBedroom 3 - 2.60m x 2.60m\n\n\nHall - 2.79 x 1.09m\n\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> Approx. 106 sq m</li><li> Off street parking</li><li> Rear access</li><li> West facing to rear</li><li> Within short walking distance of local shops</li><li> Easy access to Dublin city centre</li><li> Bay windowed</li><li> En Suite</li><li> 55 foot (approx.) garden to rear</ul>"
      },
